<title>USA: Del Webb Corp sets $150 mln in notes.</title>
<headline>Del Webb Corp sets $150 mln in notes.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from Del Webb Corp was priced on Wednesday according to lead manager Dillon Reade &amp; Co Inc.</p>
<p>BORROWER DEL WEBB CORP</p>
<p>AMT $150 MLN	 COUPON 9.75 PCT  MATURITY 01/15/2008</p>
<p>TYPE SNR SUB NOTES ISS PRICE 99.50  FIRST PAY 07/15/1997 LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 9.825 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P B-MINUS   SPREAD  N.A.     CALLABLE AFTER FIVE</p>
<p>								YEARS</p>
<p>U.S. corporate bond unit, 212 859-1678</p>
